  "metadata": {
    "id": "step_temple",
    "name": "Step Temple",
    "author": "ChronoSplit",
    "description": "A stepped marble temple round a pillared court, in the spirit of GoldenEye's Temple. Cloisters and side chambers ring the court; stairs climb to galleries that look down over half walls, and four bridges meet on a railed platform above the dais. Take the railgun from the platform and you are in everyone's sights; the heavy armour waits at the foot of the dais below.",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z",
